      ms: 12320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:15xphk5'
    male|a|grave|The best result in the whole plane and the worst carry the same ICER, because a ratio keeps the signs only as their product.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1tvtndz'
    male|a||Which is why the reporting guidelines of most agencies forbid printing a negative ICER at all — you write the word dominant, or dominated, and let the number go.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:buffc4'
    'male|a||The second failure lives where delta E is almost nothing: two analyses of the same drug, a gain of two hundredths of a QALY and a loss of the same size, half a million kroner either way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13160
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1eq8o6m'
    male|a||To the eye they are one dot — about a week of healthy life, far inside any confidence interval.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:wcj0i4'
    'male|a||But the ratio reads plus twenty-five million per QALY, then minus twenty-five million: the denominator crossing zero throws the number out to infinity and back.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:8hglm6'
    male|a||So an ICER has no honest confidence interval — it blows up precisely where the effect is uncertain, which is precisely where a decision-maker needs help.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10280
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:g0j5w7'
    'male|a||Third failure: ICERs cannot be lined up against each other.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ze1fmr'
    male|a||Treatment X against current care buys one QALY for three hundred thousand kroner — an ICER of three hundred thousand.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:55kcbt'
    male|a||Treatment Y buys two QALYs for five hundred thousand — two hundred and fifty thousand per QALY, so by the league table Y is the better buy.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9280
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:uk2qum'
    male|a||Yet if X is already on the table, moving from X to Y costs two hundred thousand more for one more QALY — a third number, and the only one that answers the choice actually in front of you.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:5q09gn'
    male|a||Every ICER belongs to a pair of options, never to one, so a column of ICERs against placebo is arithmetic without meaning.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:jqra80'
    male|a||One check before we close. An ICER of −400 000 kr per QALY — which quadrant is that technology in?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1qpuxsm'
    'male|a||A negative ratio only says ΔC and ΔE have opposite signs: it fits the dominant southeast and the dominated northwest equally well.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a|grave|A sign it cannot defend, a denominator it cannot survive, and no place in a ranking — next time we replace it with net monetary benefit, which has none of those faults.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 16320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||A hip replacement: 1.2 QALYs gained for 90 000 kroner more per patient.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1h1e6ix'
    'male|a||A rehab programme: 0.3 QALYs, and it saves 40 000 kroner — the case whose ICER came out negative and meaningless.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:gpm0gi'
    'male|a||And a new drug: 0.9 QALYs for 400 000 kroner, an ICER of about 444 000 per QALY.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:17gmde7'
    male|a||Take the threshold as given for now — 275 000 kroner per QALY, Norway's low-severity level; where that number comes from is next lecture's problem.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10960
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1aikh5m'
    male|a||Net monetary benefit converts the health gain into kroner at that price, then subtracts what it cost.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6560
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:ui09ne'
    'male|a||The hip: 275 000 times 1.2 is 330 000 kroner of health, minus 90 000 spent — plus 240 000.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1qx8i29'
    'male|a||The rehab programme: 82 500 of health, plus the 40 000 it saves — plus 122 500, and nothing was divided by anything.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12320
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1t87xw0'
    'male|a||The drug: 247 500 of health against 400 000 of cost — minus 152 500.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10640
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:85ywa4'
    male|a||The threshold line is exactly the set of points whose net benefit is zero — so net benefit is the vertical distance from that line, read off in kroner.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:15tee6s'
    'male|a||A quick check. A point sitting ABOVE the threshold line has:':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:2026c1'
    male|a||Above the line the extra cost exceeds λ times the health gained, so NMB is negative.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||Now apply severity: for the most severe conditions the accepted λ rises to 825 000, and the whole line pivots.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11000
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||The drug's net benefit turns positive, plus 342 500 — and it now outranks the rehab programme's 287 500, so the ordering itself moved with λ.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1kkp40r'
    male|a||So what does net benefit still require of you?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1tviqv4'
    'male|a||Net benefit removes the division, not the judgement: λ must be chosen up front, and the ranking depends on it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7760
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||Strip the picture away, and every option collapses into one signed number — Stinnett and Mullahy's 1998 fix for a statistics problem, since a ratio of two uncertain quantities has no well-behaved confidence interval and a difference does.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 17080
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||Fix λ at the high-severity level, and each intervention gets a value in kroner.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:movp5e'
    male|a||They rank straight down the column, and each is comparable with every other — not merely with placebo.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1c9okpa'
    'male|a||Nusinersen: 1.8 QALYs for roughly nine million kroner per patient — minus 7.5 million, even at the most generous threshold Norway allows.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10680
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:1p8qdxf'
    male|a||And because these are kroner, they add up — across patients, across programmes, across a whole budget; ICERs never could.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9040
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:19bldjg'
    'male|a|grave|Net benefit doesn''t abolish the hard judgement, it moves it to the front: name the price of a QALY first, and the arithmetic stops fighting you.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12400
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical #ctx:e1k1ej'
    male|a||Two drugs on one picture invite a reading of the whole map — because only half of it can be decided without naming a price for health.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9000
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    male|a||The quadrants are the easy part; the ICER itself deserves suspicion — because a committee that ranks technologies by delta C over delta E can approve the wrong one.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11120
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||Negative ratios, dominance, extended dominance: the cure is to rewrite the same plane in a number that cannot misbehave that way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8880
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||Read the arrow as a rise over a run: cost over effect.':
