    'male|a||Look again at south-east and north-west: those two are settled by dominance alone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Charon | a clear, warm university lecturer: measured, engaged, never theatrical'
    'male|a||It cannot be dominant or dominated: health falls, so the trade-off is against the money released.':
